<section class="hero" data-hero>
  <div class="hero-field" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shell hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="hero-topline"><span class="eyebrow">Independent security researcher</span><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-quiet">Tangerang, Indonesia · <%= Time.now.year %></span></div>
      <h1 class="hero-title"><span class="line"><span>Jody</span></span><span class="line"><span><em>Ritonga.</em></span></span></h1>
      <p class="hero-caption">A curious mind. A closer look.</p>
      <p class="hero-lede">I look for the small assumptions that become real vulnerabilities. Browser and Android security research, guided by curiosity and grounded in reproducible evidence.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#selected-work">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:jodyritonga@gmail.com">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="hero-hint">Move over the collage to look closer</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-art" data-lens>
      <img src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/security-hero-collage.webp') %>" width="1024" height="1536" alt="A blackbird investigates browser and phone evidence connected with red thread among magnolia leaves." fetchpriority="high">
      <span class="lens" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <figcaption><span>Fig. 00 / Fieldwork</span><em>evidence, edges, impact</em></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<%= ticker %>

<section class="section board-section" id="selected-work">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading reveal"><div><span class="section-number">01 / Selected research</span><h2>Small details.<br><em>Lasting impact.</em></h2></div><div class="heading-note"><p><%= @discoveries.length %> coordinated disclosures across Apple, Google, Microsoft and Mozilla. Every card is pinned to its public record.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= base('/discoveries/') %>">All public work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
    <figure class="board-banner reveal"><img src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/disclosure-collage.webp') %>" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Six paper evidence clusters connected by red thread, with browser, phone, database, bug, and lock motifs." loading="lazy"><figcaption class="plate-label"><span>Fig. 01 / The board</span><em><%= @discoveries.length %> disclosures, one habit: look closer</em></figcaption></figure>
    <div class="board" data-board>
      <svg class="board-thread" aria-hidden="true"><path d=""/></svg>
      <% @discoveries.first(3).each_with_index do |discovery, index| %><%= discovery_card(discovery, index: index + 1) %><% end %>
    </div>
    <p class="section-footnote">Responsibly disclosed. Linked to public CVE and vendor records.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section shell practice-section">
  <div class="section-heading reveal"><div><span class="section-number">02 / The practice</span><h2>Curiosity meets<br><em>conviction.</em></h2></div><div class="heading-note"><p>I use LLMs to explore possibilities, then test those ideas against the code. The evidence gets the final word.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= base('/method/') %>">My process <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
  <figure class="triptych reveal"><img src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/research-process-triptych.webp') %>" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Three connected paper scenes show observing, verifying, and responsibly disclosing a security issue." loading="lazy"></figure>
  <%= practice_steps %>
</section>

<section class="quote-band">
  <img class="quote-branch" src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/magnolia-branch.svg') %>" width="420" height="470" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy">
  <div class="shell reveal"><p>The model can suggest where to look.<br><em>The evidence decides what is real.</em></p><span class="quote-note">On working with LLMs</span></div>
</section>

<section class="personal shell">
  <figure class="plate garden-art reveal"><span class="tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/research-garden.png') %>" width="1536" height="1024" alt="A hand-drawn research garden: magnolias growing through a laptop, a magnifying glass, an open notebook, and a cup of coffee." loading="lazy"><figcaption class="plate-label"><span>From the notebook</span><em>a few things that keep me curious</em></figcaption></figure>
  <div class="reveal"><span class="section-number">Away from the screen</span><h2>Always a little<br><em>curious.</em></h2><p>About software. About the details most people pass by. And, yes, about magnolias.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= base('/about/') %>">A little about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</section>

<%= contact_band %>
